A58. You will find a double meaning in this. ~ PUN
A59. Be yourself and don't do this. ~ MIMIC
A60. What a woman does when she has nothing else to do. ~ GADS
A61. This is a daisy at telling whether he loves you or not. ~ MARGUERITE

